{"sections":[{"slug":"既约环","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"既约环"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">既约环</span>"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"既约环"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">定义</span></h2>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">既约环是满足如下等价条件的环</span> $R$:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span lang=\"zh\">对任意</span> $x\\in R$, <span lang=\"zh\">若</span> $x^2=0$, <span lang=\"zh\">则</span> $x=0$.</li>\n<li><span lang=\"zh\">对任意</span> $x\\in R$, <span lang=\"zh\">若存在正整数</span> $n$ <span lang=\"zh\">使得</span> $x^n=0$, <span lang=\"zh\">则</span> $x=0$.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">性质</span></h2>\n<h3><span lang=\"zh\">约化</span>: <span lang=\"zh\">嵌入的右伴随</span></h3>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">环范畴中</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">既约环的子范畴的嵌入</span> $i\\colon \\mathsf{Ring}_{\\mathrm{red}} \\hookrightarrow \\mathsf{Ring}$ <span lang=\"zh\">有左伴随</span> $r$, <span lang=\"zh\">将环</span> $A$ <span lang=\"zh\">对应到其</span><strong><span lang=\"zh\">约化</span></strong>\n$$\r\nA_{\\mathrm{red}} = A / \\operatorname{nil}(A).\r\n$$\n<span lang=\"zh\">其中</span> $\\operatorname{nil}(A)$ <span lang=\"zh\">为</span> $A$ <span lang=\"zh\">的幂零根</span> $\\{a\\in A\\mid \\exists n\\in\\mathbb{N},a^n = 0\\}$.</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">对约化环</span> $R$, <span lang=\"zh\">环同态</span> $A \\to R$ <span lang=\"zh\">须将</span> $\\operatorname{nil}(A)$ <span lang=\"zh\">的元素映射到</span> $0$, <span lang=\"zh\">故唯一地穿过</span> $A\\to A_{\\mathrm{red}}$.</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">该构造可用于解释</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/概形的约化","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">概形的约化</span>"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<h3><span lang=\"zh\">局部化</span></h3>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">既约环的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/局部化","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">局部化</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">仍是既约环</span>.</p>\n"}]}}}]}